 through the streets of  LA but before the bad guys are caught  suddenly the world goes into a blackout  in this period everyone loses  Consciousness and sees a glimpse of  their future Mark sees that he is alone  and stressed out at night in his office  he writes down who else knows on a page  a day calendar posts stuff on a bulletin  board and drink some alcohol the day is  April 29 2010 according to the calendar  as red laser light pierces the darkness  of Mark's office masked men enter the  room and look for Mark because he knows  too much about the global outage back in  the present everything has been  devastated for two minutes and 17  seconds everyone on Earth went  unconscious the incident has serious  consequences massive vehicle accidents  crashed aircraft blazing fires and even  a kangaroo trotting across downtown Los  Angeles if that kangaroo doesn't kick  some ass later I want my money back but  surprisingly the blackout also saved  some people for instance Bryce who is  having a go at his life was stopped when  he wakes up he interprets the strange  occurrence as a message that his death  was not meant to be with renewed  motivation he then rushes to the  hospital to assist Olivia at the  hospital everyone is left equally  confused by the blackout however they  don't have much time to think about it  as an eight-year-old boy named Dylan  Simcoe is about to undergo a surgery to  remove his brain brain tumor the weird  thing is that Dylan knows Olivia despite  her meeting him for the first time in  the next scene the heroic doctors  somehow managed to save the boy but  learned that his mother died in the  widespread blackout to make matters  worse Olivia and the hospital staff are  unable to find his father elsewhere at  the FBI headquarters Mark and Dimitri  bring in the woman they were chasing  after when the blackout occurred they  tried to interrogate her but the woman  claims that she has nothing to do with  what happened later as all the FBI  agents are in a meeting Mark shares the  specifics of his blackout Vision he  claims to have experienced a flash but  it wasn't from the past but from the  future hence they give it the name Flash  Forward oh [ __ ] they said it hearing  this the other FBI agents also reveal  that they experienced the same  phenomenon it turns out that everyone  had flashes of events that have not yet  occurred it gets weirder here all the  flashes took place on the 29th of April  2010 which is six months from now while  everyone is busy explaining their  flashes Dimitri is concerned because he  did not have one he wonders if that has  been because six months from now he will  be dead on the other hand Janice reveals  that she saw herself 17 weeks pregnant  which is odd because she doesn't even  have a boyfriend maybe it was the  kangaroo then Mark mentions that in his  vision he was investigating the cause of  The Flash Forward hearing this his boss  wedding assigns him Dimitri and Janice  to investigate the case to kick start  their investigation Janice wants to  create a website so people from around  the world can post their Visions this  way they can search for patterns that  are similar and research about them  later in his office Dimitri helps Mark  put together his vision so that they can  get a lead Mark reveals that in his  flash he saw that the name of the  investigation was Mosaic the name d  Gibbons was written on a note card there  were also some photographs one of an old  man and one of a doll that was burned  with a bullet casing nearby the words  blue hand were written on another note  one of them asked men coming to kill him  had a tattoo on his arm three stars Mark  was also wearing a friendship bracelet  like the ones kids make and lastly he  was drinking heavily elsewhere a tired  Olivia wonders what her flash meant she  had seen a man in her house and called  him honey suggesting that she and Mark  had ended their marriage Olivia is upset  because of the strong feelings she had  for the mystery man in her flash she  shares this with mark but instead of  being angry he Comforts her by saying  that just because they saw those things  happen doesn't necessarily mean they're  going to happen meanwhile at the  hospital Dylan's father Lloyd Simcoe  arrives to visit his kid in a shocking  turn of events it is revealed that the  man Olivia saw in her flash is none  other than Lloyd himself back at home  Charlie informs her father that she had  a nightmare the little girl is scared so  Mark doesn't inquire about it but just  then he notices something in her Palm  Charlie says that it is a bracelet of  friendship that she has bought for her  father the bracelet is the same one that  Mark was wearing in his flash realizing  that his flash events are unfolding Mark  becomes overwhelmed but nonetheless he  lets his daughter put the bracelet on  him at the FBI headquarters Janice has  spent the last five hours pouring over  footage from numerous security cameras  and every video depicts the same thing  people all over the globe blacking out  for 2 minutes and 17 seconds however in  one video which was recorded at a sports  event in Detroit the whole stadium crowd  Falls unconscious except for one figure  the person slowly moves along the  stadium until finally Vanishing into the  exit's Shadows he was born into the  darkness the following day at school  Charlie gets into trouble with one of  her classmates when she is forced to  share what she saw in the blackout later  at a staff meeting weda informs the LA  field office employees that six FBI  agents had quit that morning bringing  the three-day total of resignations to  18 as he continues explaining the  situation a woman interrupts him and  mocks his speech she is introduced as  Anastasia Markham Deputy Chief of  Homeland Security just then Mark's phone  ranks and he rushes at the door stating  that there is an issue at his daughter's  school in the next scene Mark meets with  Olivia and principal Bayern at Charlie's  School Bayern is concerned about the  little girl's reluctance to talk about  her vision implying that she saw some  something bad later Mark and Olivia  discussed the matter and speculate that  their daughters saw the man in Olivia's  Vision meanwhile at the FBI field office  Anastasia expresses skepticism regarding  the legitimacy of the investigation she  claims that they're spending too much  time and money on the useless website  but her demeanor quickly changes when  wedix shows her the Detroit Stadium's  security video of the person whom they  refer to as Bane I mean suspect zero  shortly after as Dimitri and Mark are  talking about D Gibbons Janice  interrupts them announcing that a woman  named Dede Gibbons is asking to see  Dimitri wasting no time the FBI agents  are questioning Gibbons when asked about  her flash she describes an angry phone  call about pigeons with an unknown  person during which she screamed at the  person to speak with Mark and Dimitri on  the other hand Olivia brings Charlie to  the hospital with her as she is working  Lloyd approaches her to thank her for  saving his son's life seeing him Olivia  realizes that he is the same man she  called honey in her flash taken aback  she takes her daughter to the room where  Dylan and her father are present a  Olivia then asks Charlie if she  recognizes Lloyd but the little girl  replies that she does not however just  as Olivia breathes a sigh of relief  Charlie notices Dylan and starts  screaming she demands to know who hurt  him indicating that she had seen him in  her flash back at the field office  Janice reports that the only interesting  information she could find on Gibbons  was that her credit card was used twice  within minutes to make purchases in  Virginia and Utah Dimitri believes that  a cloned card was used by someone else  either that or Gibbons was purchasing  some sexy time fun online just then  wetek remembers what Gibbons said  earlier she used the word pigeon a lot  of times in her flash realizing that the  word may be of significant importance  Janice searches for the term and  discovers a place called pigeon in Utah  as the discussion is going on Mark sees  his wife in the hallway and excuses  himself Olivia tells Mark about their  daughter's reaction to seeing Dylan and  about meeting the man she saw in her  flash as expected Mark is devastated to  hear this as his worst fears are  starting to come true he tries to  inquire further but just then and  Dimitri interrupts them with an  important lead it turns out that  gibbons's clone credit card has just  been used to buy a bus ticket out of  pigeon Utah later Mark and Dimitri reach  pigeon to meet with the sheriff Keegan a  local officer the FBI and the pigeon  Sheriff's Department have staked out the  local bus station in the hopes of  catching whoever cloned gibbons's credit  card believing that they are the right d  Gibbons however the bus departs after  dark with no passengers on it much to  the dismay of the group but as they are  about to leave the scene they spot an  abandoned doll factory which Mark  connects with the photograph of the doll  he saw in his flash because of the Clue  the group breaks into the factory and  sees a shadow on the Move unfortunately  while pursuing it Mark sets off a booby  trap and causes some of the hanging  dolls to bounce around soon they enter a  room and find a strange man holding two  lighters surrounded by computer  equipment he drops the lighters and they  erupt in Flames the man then shoots  Sheriff Keegan killing her on the spot  he must have known that we just met that  character and don't care about her very  much Mark and Dimitri fire back but the  mysterious man escapes and releases some  grenades setting off an explosion in the  aftermath of the incident investigators  discover a cell phone and a white queen  chess piece they believe that the  mysterious man is a heavy duty computer  hacker later the FBI agents discovered  that the cell phone discovered at the  doll factory made a phone call during  the blackout the call was made to  someone at the same stadium where  suspect zero was indicating that they  both are connected as Dimitri is leaving  the FBI building he receives an  anonymous phone call from a woman  claiming that in her flash she was in an  intelligence briefing where she learned  that Dimitri will be murdered on March  15 2010. she further tells him that he  will be shot three times before abruptly  ending the call shocked Dimitri tries  calling her back but her number is  unavailable at home mark checks in on  Charlie who is awake she tells him that  she got into trouble in school because  she was afraid of what she saw in her  flash when Mark asks what she saw she  responds D Gibbons is a bad man the next  day FBI agents discovery report about  Rudolph gair a convicted Nazi imprisoned  in kwale Germany who has requested a  meeting with Mark the whole department  is confused why an old man from another  country would ask for Mark and so they  look into his file lo and behold he  turns out to be the same man that Mark  was investigating in his flash because  of this Revelation weddik orders Mark  and Janice to head to Germany and  interrogate Geyer next Dimitri's fiancee  Zoe arrives from Seattle and the two  proceed to a motel while lying in bed  they discuss their visions and future  Dimitri is taken aback when he learns  that Zoe's flash was at their wedding  and that he was allegedly in it with a  heavy heart he lies that he also  witnessed the same event at the hospital  Olivia has lunch with her friend Felicia  where they talk about their husbands and  what they saw in the flash Felicia is  the wife of Stan one of the FBI's top  officers and a good friend of Mark she  claims to have seen a young boy ataf  whom she had never seen before living at  her home and addressing her as Mom  elsewhere Mark and Janice arrive at the  German prison where Geyer is being held  and along with the warden and Geyer's  attorney begin to question him  surprisingly the old man demands that he  be released from prison and allowed to  settle in America with his charges  dropped in exchange for the information  after a lot of deliberation Mark agrees  to the deal as though he has the  authority to do that but only if Gaia  reveals something worthy of his trust  however the old man starts explaining  riddles and useless stories which make  no sense to the detectives at all  enraged Mark gives Guyer one last chance  to be useful and the latter finally  starts describing his flash he says that  he was returning to America and at an  airport he was speaking with a customs  official Jerome Murphy he told Murphy  that he had a murder to thank for his  freedom when Mark asks why he was called  out of all people Gaia reveals that he  was sent to America because of Mark to  confirm Geyer's flash Dimitri meets with  Murphy and inquires if he also saw the  same vision surprisingly Murphy recalls  the exact same events hence confirming  that the old man was actually telling  the truth back in Germany mark promises  guy or his freedom and asks him to  explain everything else that he knows  the old man then reveals that the murder  he witnessed was the slaughter of a  large number of crows outside his prison  window although the information is not  significant he gives Mark a book about  birds to research more about them  meanwhile at a memorial service for  officers killed during the global  blackout Felicia notices ataf sitting in  the front row with a woman shortly after  Zoe pleads with Dimitri to set their  wedding date for the D-Day that is April  29 2010 Demetrius hesitant at first but  when Zoe insists he agrees after  returning to the states Mark speculates  that there could have been other events  in which large numbers of birds died he  and Janice head to the office to look  through news files surprisingly they  discover a report from Somalia in 1991  in which a large number of crows died  while residents also experienced a mass  loss of consciousness eerily similar to  the global blackout the series then  shows a flashback to 1991 in the ganwar  region of Somalia where a young boy is  seen hurting a group of goats moments  later he sees a large number of crows  flocking around him to his surprise all  the crows suddenly drop to the ground in  a panic he quickly runs over the hill to  see his village only to find a large  number of people unconscious on the  ground the episode ends as a large  aircraft in the center of the village  appears to be emitting some form of  smoke subscribe for more videos like  this turn on notifications and leave a  like to help the channel out thank you  for watching

